{"quest_id": 4194, "name": "暗黒騎士団の暗躍", "description": "田園地帯に魔物たちが出現！\n住民に被害が出る前に掃討せよ！\n\n初級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃5体）", "event": "暗黒騎士団の最期", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920033, "map_no": 3529, "level": 90, "multiplier": 0.9, "charisma": 25, "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 8, "form_count": 1, "hp": 576, "attack": 126, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 140, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097200, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 3, "spawn_sec": 1}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 7, "form_count": 1, "hp": 900, "attack": 135, "base_hp": 1000, "base_attack": 150, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 16, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 53, "move_speed": 1300.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097184, "race_id": 11, "master_id": 2, "spawn_sec": 13}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 3, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アーマー"], "hp": 2520, "attack": 360, "base_hp": 2800, "base_attack": 400, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 200, "attack_speed": 58, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 127, "move_speed": 450.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097264, "master_id": 7, "spawn_sec": 42}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "アンナ", "text": "魔物たちが多数出現したとの報告があったのは\nここですね。\n王子、迎撃致しましょう！", "face": "lefb1d0ba9c6a"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "暗黒騎士", "text": "……。", "face": "l10aac96d9b2c"}, {"name": "副団長", "text": "首尾は大丈夫なの？", "face": "ld30285a1a287"}, {"name": "暗黒騎士", "text": "フハハハ、順調よ。\n魔物を放てば王子は現れる。\n簡単な事よ。", "face": "l10aac96d9b2c"}, {"name": "副団長", "text": "幾度も戦ってるだけの事はあるってことね。\n……けど、わかってるんでしょう？", "face": "ld30285a1a287"}, {"name": "暗黒騎士", "text": "……。", "face": "l10aac96d9b2c"}, {"name": "副団長", "text": "アタシが副団長として派遣された意味。\n次失敗すれば、「あのお方」はあんたを許さない。\n団長……。", "face": "ld30285a1a287"}, {"name": "暗黒騎士", "text": "分かっている。", "face": "l10aac96d9b2c"}, {"name": "暗黒騎士", "text": "王子打倒は我が宿命……っ。\n今度こそ、今度こそ我が手で\n打ち倒してくれるっ……！", "face": "l10aac96d9b2c"}, {"name": "副団長", "text": "そういうところ、相変わらずね。\n……アタシも祈っているわ。", "face": "ld30285a1a287"}]}], "active": true}